Description: Report repeated attributes, unmatched end tags and unclosed elements
 An attribute name the tag already has reports "duplicate-attribute" with
 the range of the first, when its key holds no template. A close tag that
 matches no open element reports "x-invalid-end-tag" with the innermost
 open element and the last element of its name closed by "/>", unless it
 names a void element. An element whose open tag ended but which is left
 open, by a close tag of an ancestor or by the end of the input, reports
 "x-unclosed-element", unless HTML lets its end tag be left out.
Author: Numiko
Origin: vendor
Forwarded: no
Test: test/parser/diagnostics.test.ts ("duplicate-attribute", "x-invalid-end-tag", "x-unclosed-element")
Last-Update: 2026-11-04
